{"t_client_s": 62.538, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "a9f8fcd21f10", "seq": 34, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:10:17.606Z", "t_ms": 62399, "delta": "In **ReAct**, the interleaving of reasoning traces and actions is structured as follows:"}}
{"t_client_s": 62.541, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "a9f8fcd21f10", "seq": 35, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:10:17.611Z", "t_ms": 62403, "delta": "\n\n* **Augmented Action Space:** ReAct expands the agent's action space $\\mathcal{A}$ to $\\hat{\\mathcal{"}}
{"t_client_s": 62.672, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "a9f8fcd21f10", "seq": 36, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:10:17.742Z", "t_ms": 62534, "delta": "A}} = \\mathcal{A} \\cup \\mathcal{L}$, where $\\mathcal{L}$ represents an un"}}
{"t_client_s": 62.857, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "a9f8fcd21f10", "seq": 37, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:10:17.928Z", "t_ms": 62720, "delta": "constrained natural language space of \"thoughts\" or reasoning traces [C2].\n* **Role of Thoughts (Internal Reasoning):** When"}}
{"t_client_s": 63.064, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "a9f8fcd21f10", "seq": 38, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:10:18.134Z", "t_ms": 62927, "delta": " the model generates an action $\\hat{a}_t \\in \\mathcal{L}$, it does not interact directly with"}}
{"t_client_s": 63.265, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "a9f8fcd21f10", "seq": 39, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:10:18.334Z", "t_ms": 63127, "delta": " or affect the external environment, and therefore receives no environment observation [C2]. Instead, the thought processes the accumulated context $"}}
{"t_client_s": 63.429, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "a9f8fcd21f10", "seq": 40, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:10:18.499Z", "t_ms": 63291, "delta": "c_t$ (prior observations, actions, and thoughts) and appends itself to update the context $c_{t+1} ="}}
{"t_client_s": 63.627, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "a9f8fcd21f10", "seq": 41, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:10:18.697Z", "t_ms": 63490, "delta": " (c_t, \\hat{a}_t)$, helping the model induce, track, and update action plans,"}}
{"t_client_s": 63.79, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "a9f8fcd21f10", "seq": 42, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:10:18.855Z", "t_ms": 63647, "delta": " handle exceptions, inject commonsense knowledge, or decompose goals [C1, C2].\n* **Role of Actions and Observations"}}
{"t_client_s": 63.955, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "a9f8fcd21f10", "seq": 43, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:10:19.026Z", "t_ms": 63818, "delta": " (External Interaction):** Task-specific domain actions ($a_t \\in \\mathcal{A}$) interface directly with external environments or"}}
{"t_client_s": 64.144, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "a9f8fcd21f10", "seq": 44, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:10:19.211Z", "t_ms": 64004, "delta": " tools (such as Wikipedia search APIs) [C1, C2, C4]. These actions return environmental observations ($o_t"}}
{"t_client_s": 64.323, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "a9f8fcd21f10", "seq": 45, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:10:19.392Z", "t_ms": 64185, "delta": " \\in \\mathcal{O}$), grounding the agent's context in factual external data and mitigating hallucinations [C1, C2,"}}
{"t_client_s": 64.515, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "a9f8fcd21f10", "seq": 46, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:10:19.585Z", "t_ms": 64377, "delta": " C4].\n* **Dense Alternation:** In knowledge-intensive tasks (e.g., HotpotQA, FEVER),"}}
{"t_client_s": 64.734, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "a9f8fcd21f10", "seq": 47, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:10:19.804Z", "t_ms": 64596, "delta": " reasoning traces and actions are tightly interleaved in a synchronous `Thought -> Action -> Observation` pipeline, where thoughts extract information from observations, reason"}}
{"t_client_s": 65.052, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "a9f8fcd21f10", "seq": 48, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:10:20.049Z", "t_ms": 64841, "delta": " over facts, and adjust search plans before executing the next action [C2, C3, C4].\n* **Sparse /"}}
{"t_client_s": 65.166, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "a9f8fcd21f10", "seq": 49, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:10:20.236Z", "t_ms": 65028, "delta": " Asynchronous Interleaving:** In interactive decision-making tasks requiring long action sequences (e.g., ALFWorld, WebShop),"}}
